    "Telephony": "電話",
    "Credentials go on the APIs page: a \"Telnyx\" entry with its API key, or a \"Twilio\" entry with the account SID as client key and the auth token as API key. Leave blank to turn telephony off.": "憑證喺 API 頁面設定：一個連 API 金鑰嘅 \"Telnyx\" 項目，或者一個用帳戶 SID 做客戶端金鑰、驗證 Token 做 API 金鑰嘅 \"Twilio\" 項目。留空就關閉電話功能。",
    "From number": "撥出號碼",
    "Your number at the provider, in E.164 form: the setup button verifies it as caller ID, and inbound calls to it are answered by the agent below.": "你喺供應商嘅號碼，用 E.164 格式：設定掣會將佢驗證做來電顯示，打嚟呢個號碼嘅電話會由下面嘅代理接聽。",
    "Answer with agent": "用代理接聽",
    "The live agent that answers incoming calls.": "接聽來電嘅即時代理。",
    "Auto-accept after": "自動接聽時間",
    "Answer incoming calls automatically after this many seconds, unless answered or rejected first.": "過咗呢個秒數就自動接聽來電，除非之前已經接咗或者拒絕咗。",
    "OpenAI project ID": "OpenAI 項目 ID",
    "Calls are bridged to sip:<project id>@sip.api.openai.com.": "通話會接駁去 sip:<project id>@sip.api.openai.com。",
    "Allowed countries": "允許嘅國家",
    "Countries calls may be placed to, as comma-separated ISO codes such as GB, US. Applied to the selected provider when changed, and by its setup button.": "可以打去嘅國家，用逗號分隔嘅 ISO 代碼，例如 GB, US。改咗之後同撳設定掣時會套用到揀咗嘅供應商。",
    "Telnyx connection ID": "Telnyx 連接 ID",
    "The Telnyx voice application calls are placed through. \"Set up Telnyx\" creates it for you; its webhook URL is kept up to date automatically.": "用嚟撥出電話嘅 Telnyx 語音應用程式。\"設定 Telnyx\" 會幫你建立；佢嘅 Webhook URL 會自動保持最新。",
    "Set up Telnyx": "設定 Telnyx",
    "Creates the voice application and outbound profile through the Telnyx API, then verifies the From number as caller ID by SMS code.": "透過 Telnyx API 建立語音應用程式同撥出設定檔，再用 SMS 驗證碼將撥出號碼驗證做來電顯示。",
    "Set up Twilio": "設定 Twilio",
    "Enables the allowed countries and points the From number at the webhook through the Twilio API, then verifies the From number as caller ID with a call from Twilio if the account does not own it.": "透過 Twilio API 啟用允許嘅國家，將撥出號碼指向 Webhook；如果帳戶唔擁有呢個號碼，就用 Twilio 打嚟嘅電話將佢驗證做來電顯示。",
    "Public URL": "公開 URL",
    "Filled in automatically: a Cloudflare quick tunnel is opened to the listener whenever a provider is set, and OpenAI and the provider are pointed at it.": "自動填寫：設定咗供應商就會開一條通去監聽器嘅 Cloudflare 快速隧道，OpenAI 同供應商都會指向佢。",
